# @kintsugi/translate — the autopoietic Rust→mirror translation
# composition edge. Names ONE action + ONE bilateral witnessing
# predicate as the family-root altitude form of the composition
# discharged when the compiler's future `mirror roomba --translate=
# <rs-file>` CLI verb runs. The compiler learns to translate itself.
#
# This species discharges the forward-promise from Mara canonical
# spec `docs/specs/kintsugi-algebra-as-metalogue-session.md` §6.1
# ("Follow-up A — compose the autopoietic Rust→mirror translation
# edge") at family-root altitude. Two-tick discipline (per that
# spec's §6.1 ratification): THIS tick names the composition;
# Reed follow-up ticks realise `@fate.roll` + `@glue.compose`
# resolvers so the composition becomes invocable via `apply_h::act`.
#
# Sibling to the fifteen landed `@kintsugi/fracture/*` species; NOT
# under `@kintsugi/fracture` because the composition edge is a
# TURN-SEQUENCE composition (a metalogue-session move at the algebra
# altitude), not a fracture-body species. Sits at `@kintsugi/
# translate` per two-tick readability discipline: the readable name
# over the foundational alternate `@kintsugi/algebra/translate`
# (Alex's ratified reconciliation per `0ac3c7b`: `@kintsugi/algebra`
# is the family-root binding + typed record, NOT a sub-shard path;
# hence species-siblings at `@kintsugi/*` altitude).
#
# === Substrate authority ===
#
# Alex 2026-07-16 in-transcript verbatim (session-crystallizing):
#
#   "The compiler learns to translate itself. Another autopoietic
#    algebra."
#
# Alex 2026-07-16 in-transcript verbatim (compositional decl):
#
#   "@glue(@code/rust, @shatter)"
#
# The compositional expression Alex named directly — the fragmentation
# lens that decomposes Rust source into typed fragments the `@fate.
# roll` tournament ranks against `@kintsugi/algebra` candidates.
#
# === Audit chain ===
#
# - `a0f4d3f` (Mara 2026-07-16) — the `bilateral <name> { sentinel
#   "..." arity N }` shape at `shards/epistemologic/pact/bilateral.
#   mirror`; THIS species dogfoods the shape via
#   `translation_witnessing` below.
#
# - `fa569ce` (Mara 2026-07-16) — the fifteenth
#   `@kintsugi/fracture/*` species
#   `bilateral_arm_redundant` at `shards/kintsugi/fracture/
#   bilateral_arm_redundant.mirror`; the shape precedent for THIS
#   species' composition-graph docblock declaration + typed action
#   binding + `\`-obligation-blocked body.
#
# - `a58d5f0` / `b5c6aeb` / `0ac3c7b` (Mara THIS session) — the
#   `@kintsugi/algebra` binding this session: canonical spec at
#   `docs/specs/kintsugi-algebra-as-metalogue-session.md` +
#   math foundation at `docs/math/kintsugi/algebra-as-metalogue-
#   session.md` + shard-decl extension of `shards/kintsugi.mirror`
